  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/08/IMG_9109.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>(160 fotos) Las fiestas del barrio de San Joaqu&iacute;n, en Onda, han dado este jueves protagonismo a las mujeres y a su vaca, probada por la tarde y embolada por la noche. La misma suerte ha corrido el toro Tadrinoso, de la ganader&iacute;a de Sorando.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dijousfestessantjoaquim15/img_9020.jpg\" alt=\"img_9020\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dijousfestessantjoaquim15/img_9021.jpg\" alt=\"img_9021\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dijousfestessantjoaquim15/img_9022.jpg\" alt=\"img_9022\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dijousfestessantjoaquim15/img_9023.jpg\" alt=\"img_9023\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dijousfestessantjoaquim15/img_9024.jpg\" alt=\"img_9024\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dijousfestessantjoaquim15/img_9025.jpg\" alt=\"img_9025\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dijousfestessantjoaquim15/img_9026.jpg\" alt=\"img_9026\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dijousfestessantjoaquim15/img_9028.jpg\" alt=\"img_9028\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dijousfestessantjoaquim15/img_9029.jpg\" alt=\"img_9029\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a97